==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Ducklett|59}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*{{DL|Skill (Shuffle)|Flap}} is a {{OBP|skill|Shuffle}} in [[Pokémon Shuffle]], though {{p|Ducklett}} cannot have it.
**As an attack in the TCG, it first appeared on {{TCG ID|Majestic Dawn|Starly|75}} from the {{TCG|Majestic Dawn}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

